@startuml ScanOneSample
skinparam BoxPadding 20

actor User as user

box "Instrument" #LightGrey
	participant Client #LightSkyBlue
	participant Client.ViewModels #LightSkyBlue
	participant Client.Notifications.Services #LightSkyBlue
	participant gRPC #LightGreen
end box

box "Pharos-Server" #LightSkyBlue
	participant Application.Instrument.Grpc #LightGreen
	participant Application.Instrument.Commands
	participant Application.Instrument.EventHandlers
	participant Application.Infrastructure.Notifications
end box

'Scan one Sample'
user -> gRPC : Send operational state (Assay)

'Send instrument storage'
gRPC -> Application.Instrument.Grpc : grpc SendOperationalState
note over Application.Instrument.Grpc: PharosServiceImplementation.cs
Application.Instrument.Grpc -> Application.Instrument.Commands : Send UpdateInstrumentStatusCommand
Application.Instrument.Commands -> Application.Instrument.EventHandlers : Publish InstrumentStateChangedEvent
Application.Instrument.EventHandlers -> Application.Infrastructure.Notifications : _hub.StateChanged(instrument)
note over Application.Infrastructure.Notifications: Hubs\\InstrumentHub.cs
note over Application.Infrastructure.Notifications: Get group for this instrument, and send message.
Application.Infrastructure.Notifications --> Client.Notifications.Services: GetClientGroup(instrumentId).SampleDrawerContentsChanged(instrumentId); 
note over Client.Notifications.Services: InstrumentStateNotificationProvider.cs
note over Client.Notifications.Services: Listening on\nIInstrumentStorageHub.SampleDrawerContentsChanged
Client.Notifications.Services --> Client.Notifications.Services: OnNext(DataNotificationType.UpdatedObject, Instrument.FromDto(instrument))
note over Client.Notifications.Services: NotificationProviderBase.cs
Client.Notifications.Services --> Client.Notifications.Services: _observers.ForEach(o => o.OnNext(new DataNotification<TModel>(notificationType, model)))
Client.Notifications.Services --> Client.ViewModels: Common\\SingletonViewModel.cs: OnNext()
note over Client.ViewModels: Model = value.Data;\nOnPropertyChanged(null);


@enduml